# INVWINHS.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: a category
# renamed while the item list shows, a list scrolled sideways, on the
# data of TEST/KEYS/SEED.REQ and RLLONG.REQ (INVWIN_WINSEEDHS).  The
# frame maximized, Items > Categories edits SYS's name to Machines and
# Esc closes the list: the item list names it anew (RENAMED).  The audit
# log of item 1, wider than the frame, shows its horizontal bar at 0
# (AUDIT); RIGHT scrolls it a cell (RIGHT1), again (RIGHT2), LEFT back
# (LEFT1), twice more to 0, where the second is held (LEFT0), and
# seventeen times RIGHT to the bar's end, where the last is held
# (RIGHTEND).  Esc goes back; the audit log of the ITEMS table, the
# seeding's 66 rows, wider than the frame and longer than its window,
# shows a page of rows above its horizontal bar (AUDITALL).  The end by
# Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINHS.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-SPACE X
K ALT-I C ALT-E
T Machines
K ENTER ESC
S RENAMED
K ALT-A A TAB
T 1
K ENTER
T items
K ENTER
S AUDIT
K RIGHT
S RIGHT1
K RIGHT
S RIGHT2
K LEFT
S LEFT1
K LEFT LEFT
S LEFT0
K RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT
K RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT
S RIGHTEND
# the filter as left: the record cleared, the table typed over
K ESC ALT-A A TAB DEL STAB
T items
K ENTER
S AUDITALL
K ESC ALT-F X
